OL,3,GNEWSANo consent for large AI data
OL,4,Acentres before Christmas, MSPs told
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning consent for large data centres
OL,7,Fin Scotland is "highly unlikely" to be
OL,8,Fgranted in the next three months, the
OL,9,FScottish government says.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Greens have called for
OL,12,Fapplication processes to be paused
OL,13,Funtil new national guidelines are in
OL,14,Fforce - with an emphasis on energy
OL,15,Fdemand and the environment.
OL,17,FMinisters, while rejecting that call,
OL,18,Fsay they will publish the guidance by
OL,19,FChristmas and told MSPs they don't
OL,20,Fexpect any planning decisions to be
OL,21,Fmade before then.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
