OL,3,GNEWSANo consent for large AI data
OL,4,Acentres before Christmas, MSPs told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have also announced that new and
OL,7,Fexisting applications for AI data
OL,8,Fcentres will have to undergo an
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact assessment.
